## Acceptance criteria

1. Each shipped invariant derives its expectation from the runtime authority, never from a restatement of it, and carries a **bidirectional pin** so a reworded authority fails the guard rather than silently disarming it.
2. Each carries a **non-vacuity witness**: a mutant that reintroduces the real historical defect must fail the guard, hand-run and recorded. (#175 shipped a guard that passed its own witness *and* the restored defect because it excluded newlines — the witness must be the real text, not a paraphrase.)
